<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:34.790
<i>Drip, drip, drip...</i>

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:42.790
<i>Darkness drips, blood drips.
Who writhes there?</i>

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:52.090
CHAPTER 11

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:56.930
CONQUER JAPAN! THE 808 TANUKI ARMY

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:06.900
Huh?

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:11.150
What the...? The moon split.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:11.950
What's going on?

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:14.490
-Whoa!
-Is it some sort of CG event?

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.700
The moon's falling!

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:26.210
Huh?

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.550
-It stopped.
-You're right!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:28.590
What's going on?!

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:32.800
<i>I repeat, civilians are asked
to refrain from going out.</i>

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:34.680
SECOND MOON APPEARS OVER TOKYO BAY

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:34.680
<i>Currently, the second moon-like object...</i>

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.720
Mana, what should we do?

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:38.270
Mana!

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:40.640
But I can't connect to the internet!

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:42.520
I can't use RAIN messenger!

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:44.860
Complaining about the internet
at a time like this?

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:47.480
I can't reach Dad either!

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.030
Don't worry about him.

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.740
Why are you so confident?

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:55.490
He goes to the office even when all
the trains are down from a typhoon.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.780
He'll come home no matter what.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.750
<i>This is to the government of Japan.</i>

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:07.880
<i>Hand over control to us,
the 808 Tanuki, immediately.</i>

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.460
<i>The second moon is but a warning.</i>

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:15.590
<i>Resist, and something even worse
shall befall Japan.</i>

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:17.100
What do we do?!

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.600
But, they're <i>tanuki</i>!

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:22.480
Dealing with <i>tanuki</i> is like a joke.
Never saw it coming!

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.900
The second moon is a reality!

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:29.070
100 meters across, it remains
stationary at 500 meters in the air.

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:32.570
Taking control of the airwaves is
a violation of radio laws!

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:37.200
Prime Minister. Victory to the quick.
Let's shoot down the second moon!

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:40.410
And who will take responsibility
if we do that?

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.580
Then what do we do?!

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.620
First, for bay areas A to H,

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:49.670
send an emergency evacuation order to
anyone within 5 km of the second moon.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.170
Place a curfew over the other areas.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:58.180
<i>A curfew has been placed
over this entire area.</i>

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.890
<i>"Cat-san, </i>tanuki<i> are on TV demanding</i>
<i>the government hand over Japan!!"</i>

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.640
Oh man.

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.640
<i>"Error. Message cannot be sent.
Please try again."</i>

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:04.100
It's still no good...

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.060
I know!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.940
I should put a letter in
the Yokai Mailbox.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:16.570
I think it was around here.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.070
Mana-chan!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.200
Oh, Rat Man-san. Don't scare me like that.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:26.080
What are you doing?
The city's under martial law.

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:27.880
Where are you going?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.000
I was taking this letter to
the Yokai Mailbox.

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:32.710
Hmm. Kitaro, huh?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:37.930
<i>Tanuki</i> folks! I've got a traitor here!

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.390
Huh?!

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.610
It's the age of the <i>tanuki</i> now.

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:56.360
Right, boss?

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:01.950
We don't want Kitaro
getting involved right now.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:05.120
Take the young girl away.

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:11.000
No! Let go!

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:13.210
Let go of me!

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:27.940
"The 808 Tanuki have appeared
and Japan's in trouble!

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.100
Help!! Mana Inuyama."

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:32.810
Hmm. The 808 Tanuki, huh?

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:34.820
You know of them, Dad?

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:36.030
Yes.

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:41.160
The 808 Tanuki were a group of <i>tanuki</i>
that once occupied the Shikoku region.

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:46.120
Gyobu-Danuki, the <i>tanuki</i> with
the greatest <i>yokai</i> power, leads.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:52.630
With Danichiro, Danjiro, Danzaburo, and
their <i>tanuki</i> followers, they number 808.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.500
The reason they ruled Shikoku

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:58.420
was largely due to the power of
the Yokai Beast they worship.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:03.010
However, over 200 years ago,
a famous monk

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:06.270
was said to have used a paper talisman
to seal them away.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:09.980
So, if the 808 Tanuki
are back, that means...

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:13.270
Indeed. Someone must have broken the seal.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.520
Kitaro, we can't just sit around!

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:17.400
Right, Dad.

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.360
Two moons?

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:24.450
No. One is the Yokai Beast's egg.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:25.450
Its egg?

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:30.710
Yes. The Yokai Beast comes from
a 700-year-old snake, called the Koryu

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:33.420
that enters a mirage and lays its egg.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:38.340
That egg falls to the earth,
and after centuries underground,

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.970
it rises to the sky once again.

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:44.220
What does that mean?

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:50.430
Gyobu-Danuki and the others don't seem to
know how to get that egg down from there.

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:55.860
If it should fall to the earth, the Yokai
Beast will awaken and it'll be a disaster.

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:58.190
We have to do something first...

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:04.660
What?!

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.330
What is it, Catchick?

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:09.290
It's saying the <i>tanuki</i> have taken Mana!

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:18.130
Huh?!

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.170
They're under this rock?!

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:23.760
This is a Shakushi Rock.

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:27.010
They used to be on the side of
lonely rural roads,

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:32.520
but with the housing development, this one
ended getting left in a place like this.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.860
I didn't realize there was
such a tunnel beneath Tokyo.

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:50.620
The 808 Tanuki must have
used underground tunnels

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:52.960
to get from Shikoku to Tokyo.

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:55.870
Gyobu-Danuki-sama!

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:58.090
What?

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.710
GYOBU-DANUKI

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:04.720
This is Mana Inuyama.
She's friends with Kitaro.

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:10.970
Kitaro is the <i>yokai</i> you mentioned before
who acts like a hero?

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:16.310
That's right. Because of them, I don't
know how many times I've been hurt!

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.610
He's always helping you!

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:22.570
Listen, Mana-chan.
This is the world of <i>yokai</i>.

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:26.820
Human or <i>yokai</i>, you can tell
whose words carry more weight, right?

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.330
Kitaro!

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:40.590
Prime Minister, in five minutes defense
forces will begin the second moon attack.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.050
Is that all right?

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:44.170
But...

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:46.010
Why are you hesitating?!

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:49.220
It'll be too late once
there's secondary damage!

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.600
So you're Kitaro!

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.980
Oh? Isn't he handsome?

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:58.150
808 Tanuki, give Mana back!

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:00.230
Kitaro, was it?

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:05.030
Have you never read
the Yokai Dictionary preface?

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:09.160
You mean that stuff about the 21st century
being the age of <i>yokai</i>?

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:10.620
That's right.

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:14.700
Our rule is prophesized destiny,
so to speak.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:19.290
If you consider yourself a <i>yokai</i>,
what problem is there for you?

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:22.210
I'm not interested in anything like that.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:26.840
The humans will eventually
be ruled by us <i>tanuki</i>.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:28.090
Kitaro.

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:34.100
You will convince the other <i>yokai</i>
to come under our rule!

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:36.020
I could never do that!

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:40.980
Do you care what happens to
this female if you refuse?

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:44.440
Hurry and decide, Prime Minister!

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:48.450
If something should happen,
who's going to take responsibility?!

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:50.160
You're saying that now?!

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:58.790
-Prime Minister!
-Prime Minister!!

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:00.750
-Prime Minister!
-Prime Minister!!

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:02.830
Fine...

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:04.670
Do it.

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:20.850
Thank goodness.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:35.080
THE 808 TANUKI

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:39.580
KITARO AND RAT MAN

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:38.580
<i>-"No passing."
-"Ge."</i>

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:39.580
<i>"Look me in the eye and tell me."</i>

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:43.500
The foolish humans have
knocked down the moon!

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:46.340
They didn't realize
it was the Yokai Beast's egg!

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:52.130
Ah! So that means at last
our Yokai Beast-sama shall awaken!

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:55.720
Yes. Thanks to the humans!

00:11:55.850 --> 00:12:01.190
Well, the Yokai Beast-sama
will take care of the humans.

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:02.810
The problem is...

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.770
the <i>yokai</i>.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:10.360
Kitaro, I have an idea.

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:11.990
For now we...

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:16.030
Don't you have an answer?

00:12:16.490 --> 00:12:17.620
All right.

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:19.290
Kitaro?

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.950
I'll do as you say!

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:23.620
In return, release Mana!

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:25.670
You're a brazen one!

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:28.050
Like we'd release our hostage!

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.460
Very well.

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:31.880
Gyobu-Danuki-sama!

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:32.800
However!

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:33.800
Huh?

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.760
Let go!

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:44.060
Listen up!

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:48.650
If Kitaro is unable to control the <i>yokai</i>,
I shall activate my spell!

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:51.900
It will turn you into a <i>tanuki yokai</i>!

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:53.110
What?!

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.030
I don't want that!

00:12:55.160 --> 00:13:01.620
If you don't want it, then make sure
you ask Kitaro to do as we say!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:03.330
Mana!

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:05.960
Kitaro!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.750
Make sure you keep your promise.

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:13.220
Otherwise, she'll become one of us!

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.720
Man, that hurt!

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:24.600
Kitaro, that was a mean move earlier.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:29.480
Rat Man, what do you intend to do
by following the 808 Tanuki?

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:32.780
Screw intensions.
It's the age of the <i>tanuki</i>-sama now.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:36.150
And I'm the 808 Tanuki-san's
first underling.

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:37.570
I'll get my cut.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:43.040
So hurry up and get the other <i>yokai</i>
under control for me, huh?

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.580
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:47.920
You bastard!

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.710
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:53.630
Catchick.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:57.010
Take care of Mana. And tell Sand Witch
and the others about this.

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:58.260
Got it!

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:00.350
What will you two do?

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.680
We have a job to do!

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:04.890
Let's go, Kitaro!

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:06.270
Yes, Dad!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:25.910
What?!

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.290
Something's shining!

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:36.760
What is happening?

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:50.600
What is that?

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:52.190
A giant creature?!

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:54.270
Is this the <i>tanuki</i>'s doing?!

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:59.990
Is this what they meant by "something even
worse shall befall Japan"?!

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.880
<i>Target the unidentified creature!</i>

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.010
<i>Fire!</i>

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:17.880
Roger!

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:29.350
Huh?!

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:36.980
Our weapons don't work at all?!

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:39.570
The F-35s are on their way.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:43.320
The second and third attack helicopter
teams are also moving out.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:48.620
If that unidentified creature goes wild
and there are casualties,

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:51.420
it's going to be the government's fault.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:55.170
We'll shoot and shoot and shoot
like crazy. I swear we'll take it down!

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:58.460
Are you sure about that?

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:02.340
I'm the one who's going to
have to take responsibility!

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:06.680
<i>Locked on target.
Requesting permission to fire.</i>

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:09.520
All right! Show them mankind's power!

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:10.770
<i>Roger.</i>

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:16.440
Yes!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.570
See? Science is victorious!

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:20.150
They're only <i>tanuki</i> after all!

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:22.860
Huh?!

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:26.390
This is... the <i>tanuki</i>'s... power?

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.860
<i>We have just been attacked
by the unidentified creature.</i>

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:41.820
DON'T BOW TO THE <i>TANUKI</i>'S TYRANNY!!
AKIRA TAKAMI

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:43.900
-We must unite to overcome this crisis!
-<i>Please evacuate...</i>

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:45.990
Dad! Mom!

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:47.570
Mana!

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:48.820
You're all right!

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:51.870
Honestly! Where were you?

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:53.290
We looked for you.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:54.960
I'm sorry.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.120
Let's just get to the shelter!

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:58.130
Okay!

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:04.510
Catchick, is this it?

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:05.220
Yeah.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:08.140
Okay. Leave it to me.

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:11.350
Huh?

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:20.060
It's no good.

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:22.900
It moved easily earlier...

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:25.690
Wally Wall.

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:28.700
Wally Wall.

00:18:29.070 --> 00:18:33.160
Wally... Wall!

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.790
You're kidding!
The entrance was just here!

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:40.290
You got away, so they must have
closed off the tunnel.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.420
What're we gonna do now?

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:47.760
Gonna do or oughta do, our only choice is
to leave it to Kitaro and Daddy Eyeball!

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.970
Just a little further to the Kaname Stone!

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:51.180
The Kaname Stone?

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:55.890
It's the source of the Yokai Beast
and the <i>tanuki</i>'s energy!

00:18:56.810 --> 00:19:00.400
Our only hope to save Japan
is to destroy it!

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.360
Hurry, Kitaro!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:03.770
Yes, Dad!

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:07.780
Prime Minister, it's time to decide.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:14.580
If the Yokai Beast-sama goes on a rampage,
Tokyo, no, Japan will be decimated.

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:21.000
If you had just handed over power to us,
you wouldn't have unnecessary casualties.

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:24.380
Well?

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:29.170
If I hand over power, all the
responsibility goes to you, you know?

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:32.510
Of course. We're well aware of that.

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:37.270
So, what will it be?!

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:40.350
Very well...

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:43.110
We'll do as you say...

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:45.440
-Prime Minister!
-How could you?!

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:51.660
<i>The </i>tanuki<i> took control from us...</i>

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:54.740
<i>Is this... my fault?!</i>

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:00.460
This is the Kaname Stone...

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:02.790
Kitaro, destroy it!

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.380
Yes, Dad!

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.210
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.060
Kitaro!

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:22.810
D-Dad...

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.150
Kitaro!

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:27.690
B-But...

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:34.280
No more. I can't run any further...

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:36.240
Hey, look!

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:39.330
K-Kitaro?!

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:43.120
That idiot touched the Kaname Stone!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.000
Wh-What do you mean?!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.380
Gyobu-Danuki-sama placed a curse
on the Kaname Stone.

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:51.630
It turns <i>yokai</i> that touch it to stone.

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:52.930
A curse?!

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:54.930
Hold it!

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:58.220
Don't touch! Touching him
will turn you to stone, too.

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:02.060
Well, a half-<i>yokai</i> like you
might be all right.

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:04.060
I wouldn't try, though.

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:08.770
They put a curse on it...

00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:12.530
I'm sorry, Kitaro! This is my fault!

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:17.200
Hold on! I swear I'll rescue you!

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:20.990
<i>Citizens of Japan!</i>

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:20.990
THE AGE OF <i>TANUKI</i>!
THE JAPANESE GOVERNMENT HANDS OVER POWER

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:27.170
<i>Today, the Japanese government has
handed over power to the 808 Tanuki.</i>

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:32.090
<i>We </i>tanuki<i> shall</i>
<i>oversee your safety and future.</i>

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:34.880
<i>We shall be amending your laws
as necessary,</i>

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:37.760
<i>so watch for government announcements.</i>

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.220
Kitaro...

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.470
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.470
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.930
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.930
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.300
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.300
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.810
<i>At this rate Japan really will</i>
<i>belong to the </i>tanuki<i>!</i>

00:23:09.940 --> 00:23:11.020
<i>Dad!</i>

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:14.190
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.320 --> 00:23:16.940
<i>"Capital Annihilated!
The Terrifying Yokai Beast"</i>

